{"slug":"usc-trojan-legend-lendale-white-lays-into-lincoln-riley-and-scs-defensive-after-cotton-bowl-loss-to-tulane","postId":75499,"title":"USC Trojan Legend LenDale White Lays Into Lincoln Riley And SC's Defensive After Cotton Bowl Loss To Tulane","htmlContent":"<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Most associated with USC football would be very optimistic about the program's future in spite of a disappointing end to Lincoln Riley's first season as head coach. LenDale White is not among them.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The former USC was running back on Twitter after the Trojans blew a 15-point lead with less than five minutes to lose 46-45 to Tulane in the Cotton Bowl. In a series of tweets, White criticized Riley and the defense, and even went so far as to say that it was “a shame to be a Trojan” right now.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/thereal_lendale/status/1610032495520780290?s=20u0026t=rl27-gLVBzlCCidfs43o7Q\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/thereal_lendale/status/1610032495520780290?s=20&amp;t=rl27-gLVBzlCCidfs43o7Q\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>White did not stop there, he would later release a tweet <a href=\"https://twitter.com/thereal_lendale/status/1610035902172246016\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">at Riley</a>, “that bend don’t break Defense s–t you brought from OU ain’t gonna cut it.”</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/thereal_lendale/status/1610035902172246016?s=20u0026t=1tAHkq06GrSJ-3ibIN4JFg\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/thereal_lendale/status/1610035902172246016?s=20&amp;t=1tAHkq06GrSJ-3ibIN4JFg\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>'He added, that “our defense and whoever’s a part of it is a f***ing joke.”</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/thereal_lendale/status/1610032257473052672?s=20u0026t=BOTtEwvbh5R0VPcqKjzIkg\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/thereal_lendale/status/1610032257473052672?s=20&amp;t=BOTtEwvbh5R0VPcqKjzIkg\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>White also retweeted a response he received asking that defensive coordinator Alex Grinch be fired.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":520805,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/323370411_901527051268253_3797354102193301167_n-1024x855.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-520805\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Former Trojan quarterback turned Fox college football analyst Matt Leinart also weighted in with, \"Same issues all year long from this defense.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/MattLeinartQB/status/1609993336009654274?s=20u0026t=1tAHkq06GrSJ-3ibIN4JFg\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/MattLeinartQB/status/1609993336009654274?s=20&amp;t=1tAHkq06GrSJ-3ibIN4JFg\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Many believe if it wasn't for the defensive issues this year the Trojans would have been in the College Football  Playoffs this year, and possibly playing for a National Championship. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->","excerpt":"Most associated with USC football would be very optimistic about the program's future in spite of a disappointing end to Lincoln Riley's first season as head coach. LenDale White is not among them.…","publishedAt":"2023-01-03T06:00:00Z","modifiedAt":"2023-01-03T06:00:00Z","author":{"slug":"tony-mcknight","displayName":"Tony McKnight"},"categories":[{"slug":"sports","name":"Sports"}],"tags":[{"slug":"byron-nelson","name":"Byron Nelson"},{"slug":"landon-buford","name":"Landon Buford"},{"slug":"lendale-white","name":"LenDale White"},{"slug":"lincoln-riley","name":"Lincoln Riley"},{"slug":"matt-leinart","name":"Matt Leinart"},{"slug":"usc-trojans","name":"USC Trojans"}],"heroImage":{"originalUrl":"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/323370411_901527051268253_3797354102193301167_n-1024x855.jpg"},"inlineImageUrls":["http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/323370411_901527051268253_3797354102193301167_n-1024x855.jpg"],"readingTimeMin":1,"type":"post","link":"https://landonbuford.com/usc-trojan-legend-lendale-white-lays-into-lincoln-riley-and-scs-defensive-after-cotton-bowl-loss-to-tulane/"}